@* The one notice of a form whose change sends the form by itself (T552; WCAG 2.2 3.2.2; text: ChangeNotice.Text). Hidden until common.js shows it: without a script nothing is sent by a change, the form's own button sends it. *@
<p class="change-notice" data-js="@Shopfolio.Pages.Components.ChangeNotice.Marker" hidden>@Shopfolio.Pages.Components.ChangeNotice.Text</p>
